  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are as one with your worm-like mount.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Worm Rider.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You add your mythic tier to Ride when astride a worm-like creature (GM’s discretion) and one-half your mythic tier to the bonus your worm-like mount gains on overrun combat maneuvers and to your CMD to resist being dismounted. This latter bonus also applies against any effect that would physically separate you from your mount. You can also use your Mounted Combat feat to deflect attacks against your worm mount an additional number of times per round equal to one-half your mythic tier. You can cling to your worm’s back while burrowing, climbing, or swimming for 1 minute times your mythic tier, plus a number of rounds equal to your number of ranks in the Ride skill. If your worm mount burrows through solid ice or stone, you can cling to it for a number of rounds equal to your mythic tier.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-n-z-feats#toc149\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
